            <ArticleTitle>DOCK8 deficiency in six Iranian patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>593-600</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ccr3.574</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>DOCK8 deficiency is a rare autosomal recessive combined immunodeficiency with high IgE level, eosinophilia, severe eczema, extensive cutaneous viral, and respiratory bacterial infections, mostly in populations with higher prevalence of consanguinity. Molecular diagnosis of this gene is a useful approach for early diagnosis and timely HSCT due to deleterious consequences.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
